Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 02:04:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): retain operator delivery across continuation
 runs [daveey]

Completion receipts belong to the original authenticated requesting task/run, not only the current attempt. Match historical same-task run UIDs. On moved continuations without the gateway-local ledger, locate the original event in the replica and authenticate the exact request and applied result with canonical Board evidence. Preserve local pending/failed refusal, task/board/actor/content binding and transactional rechecks; never resend comments or fabricate ledger rows.

Proof: RED same-host caller/run mismatch and moved missing-request failures; GREEN 168 operator/delivery/schema tests plus expanded 13-case continuation suite. Full scripts/check: 20 checks pass.
